  "body": "Bright, welcoming and beautifully finished, this is the kind of home that feels good from the moment you arrive. A soaring raking ceiling creates an impressive sense of height at the entrance, while the single-level layout unfolds with an easy sense of space, warmth and connection. Set on approximately 447sqm of freehold land and offering approximately 155.7sqm of floor area, the home features four bedrooms and three bathrooms, including two ensuites, complemented by central air conditioning, underfloor bathroom heating and a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee. It is modern family living with comfort built into every detail.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan kitchen, dining and living area is made for the rhythm of everyday life - relaxed mornings, family dinners and evenings spent together. Natural light enhances the fresh contemporary interior. Generous bench space and storage provide plenty of room for everyday cooking and entertaining, while the built-in oven and microwave integrate neatly into the cabinetry for a clean, streamlined finish.\r\n\r\nStep outside and the living experience continues onto a generous timber deck, creating a natural extension of the home's social spaces. There is plenty of room for an outdoor setting, summer barbecues or simply enjoying a quiet afternoon in the sun, while the adjoining lawn and landscaped garden bring a touch of greenery and a pleasant sense of privacy. It's an easy-care outdoor setting designed to be enjoyed rather than maintained.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation has been arranged with privacy in mind. The master bedroom enjoys its own ensuite and walk-in wardrobe, while the bedroom located just off the entrance also comes complete with a private ensuite - a valuable touch for extended family, older children or overnight guests. Two further bedrooms are served by the family bathroom, complete with a bathtub for the practicalities of family life.\r\n\r\nComfort is felt throughout the home, with central air conditioning keeping the temperature just right through every season and underfloor heating bringing an extra touch of warmth to the bathrooms on cooler mornings. Internal single garage access adds everyday convenience, while the 10-Year Master Build Guarantee offers added peace of mind.\r\n\r\nPositioned in Stanmore Bay on the beautiful Whangaparaoa Peninsula, the home places coastal living and everyday convenience within easy reach. Local beaches, schools, parks, shopping and recreational facilities are all readily accessible, along with Coast Plaza and the wider Silverdale retail and commercial hub. With the future Penlink connection set to further enhance access between the peninsula and wider Auckland, this location is well positioned for even greater connectivity.\r\n\r\nFresh, comfortable and effortlessly liveable, this is a home where thoughtful design, modern comforts and inviting indoor-outdoor living come together beautifully.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing and come experience it for yourself.",
